{"answer":"$\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$","category":"数学分析","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-calc-001","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":348,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"5004c295d571178a1ce8c6850116427a945197c1b5849afa88864869a3d4c6be","problem":"求极限 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\sin\\frac{k\\pi}{n}$。","record_version_sha256":"d8e0dd494f401ed99e8ab604181bea6f93872b2f9f560bf8f6482d8f01eef9d6","solution":"该和式为函数 $f(x)=\\sin(\\pi x)$ 在 $[0,1]$ 上 $n$ 等分的黎曼和（取右端点 $\\dfrac{k}{n}$）：$\\dfrac{1}{n}\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\sin\\dfrac{k\\pi}{n}=\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\sin\\left(\\pi\\cdot\\dfrac{k}{n}\\right)\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{n}$。由定积分定义，$\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\dfrac{1}{n}\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\sin\\dfrac{k\\pi}{n}=\\int_0^1\\sin(\\pi x)\\,dx=\\left[-\\dfrac{\\cos\\pi x}{\\pi}\\right]_0^1=-\\dfrac{\\cos\\pi}{\\pi}+\\dfrac{\\cos 0}{\\pi}=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}+\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}=\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$。","source_line":1,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"极限×定积分","task_sha256":"80bfc92b5954bcbbcb29467182d09bd272a1d28a83dabc250c161a843159bb84"}
{"answer":"$\\dfrac{1}{2}$","category":"数学分析","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-calc-002","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":349,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"caea9856032be73d40b56136919b4768cb8df9d19887ca6cc024bc59b4e97bae","problem":"求极限 $\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}n^2\\left(1-\\cos\\frac{1}{n}\\right)$。","record_version_sha256":"5fb47be3b5d0cb5c3f5db0bd58b432b38fad9600d065fa2644e3de57945cc7b4","solution":"由 $\\cos x=1-\\dfrac{x^2}{2}+o(x^2)$，取 $x=\\dfrac{1}{n}\\to 0$：$1-\\cos\\dfrac{1}{n}=\\dfrac{1}{2n^2}+o\\left(\\dfrac{1}{n^2}\\right)$。故 $n^2\\left(1-\\cos\\dfrac{1}{n}\\right)=n^2\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{2n^2}+n^2\\cdot o\\left(\\dfrac{1}{n^2}\\right)\\to\\dfrac{1}{2}$。","source_line":2,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"数列极限×泰勒公式","task_sha256":"c46e3de89ed0ee6cf704fd1311a810b982d6c49e45c9167f54d78b73d4f3dd2c"}
{"answer":"$F'(x)=\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}$；$F''(x)=\\dfrac{1-\\ln x}{x^2}$；$F(x)=\\dfrac{(\\ln x)^2}{2}$","category":"数学分析","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-calc-003","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":350,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"b9870e17ce963fe24035e99d249ba720869f5b6bd70bea728415c01ecdd62c39","problem":"设 $F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_1^x\\frac{\\ln t}{t}\\,dt$（$x>0$）。求 $F'(x)$、$F''(x)$，并给出 $F(x)$ 的显式表达式。","record_version_sha256":"6b23429644c8f9a64d47ca4e2f685ae73a1662c431172908fe9f49fdd2f5198d","solution":"由微积分基本定理，$F'(x)=\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}$。再求导：$F''(x)=\\dfrac{\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot x-\\ln x\\cdot 1}{x^2}=\\dfrac{1-\\ln x}{x^2}$。显式积分：令 $u=\\ln t$（$du=\\dfrac{dt}{t}$），$F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\ln x}u\\,du=\\dfrac{(\\ln x)^2}{2}$（下限 $t=1$ 对应 $u=0$）。验证：$F'(x)=\\dfrac{2\\ln x}{2}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{x}=\\dfrac{\\ln x}{x}$，一致。","source_line":3,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"变限积分×导数","task_sha256":"3aa21b2d34d0b9c1f117255de1860e51d75849b2a811a888c637d9f7a5fa936d"}
{"answer":"$y=e^{-x}+Ce^{-2x}$","category":"数学分析","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-calc-004","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":351,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"ad5316096bcbb8275d6224d4df315b81d1c159527f6b2f76028af053007edf2a","problem":"求微分方程 $y'+2y=e^{-x}$ 的通解。","record_version_sha256":"7739d24513650882f73102b8c94aa6d2caece4180e8880faac512c5fb9f115d9","solution":"积分因子 $\\mu(x)=e^{\\int 2\\,dx}=e^{2x}$。方程两边乘 $e^{2x}$：$e^{2x}y'+2e^{2x}y=e^{x}$，即 $(e^{2x}y)'=e^{x}$。积分得 $e^{2x}y=e^{x}+C$，故通解 $y=e^{-x}+Ce^{-2x}$。","source_line":4,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"微分方程×一阶线性","task_sha256":"3ed75bec2f567e55b0d93213981383b62599727383082b0fb391ac5aa8ee1d05"}
{"answer":"交点 $(2,1,1)$；平面 $x-z=1$","category":"解析几何","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-geom-001","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":393,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"4d27a5c2d901ca31bb9c2ccdc17cb928e98c0cfd2b7f7f258ba83d69096a35cc","problem":"求两直线 $l_1:\\begin{cases}x=1+t\\\\y=2-t\\\\z=t\\end{cases}$ 与 $l_2:\\begin{cases}x=2+s\\\\y=1+2s\\\\z=1+s\\end{cases}$ 的交点，并求过两直线的平面方程。","record_version_sha256":"79aebecc9f68af1f6e4f6fb5a1028dc65cd0117e5bc030c215700f6f238c9170","solution":"求交点：$\\begin{cases}1+t=2+s\\\\2-t=1+2s\\\\t=1+s\\end{cases}$。由第三式 $t=1+s$，代入第一式：$1+1+s=2+s$ 恒等；代入第二式：$2-(1+s)=1+2s$，即 $1-s=1+2s$，$s=0$，$t=1$。交点为 $(2,1,1)$。两直线方向：$\\vec{s_1}=(1,-1,1)$，$\\vec{s_2}=(1,2,1)$。过两直线的平面法向量 $\\vec n=\\vec{s_1}\\times\\vec{s_2}=((-1)\\cdot 1-1\\cdot 2,\\ 1\\cdot 1-1\\cdot 1,\\ 1\\cdot 2-(-1)\\cdot 1)=(-3,0,3)$，取 $(1,0,-1)$。平面方程：$(x-2)-(z-1)=0$，即 $x-z=1$。","source_line":46,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"空间直线×平面","task_sha256":"13d8da6f0157fe979d5e24ab163022f5911adf158dc57d50878dda974b5ddb42"}
{"answer":"距离 $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3}{7}}$；垂足 $\\left(\\dfrac{11}{7},\\dfrac{15}{7},\\dfrac{19}{7}\\right)$","category":"解析几何","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-geom-002","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":394,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"28e59bbd2e6bd656425591f9f0afb9c8eec64f90fe89f089c7a73db439593c63","problem":"求点 $P(1,2,3)$ 到直线 $l:x=1+t,\\ y=1+2t,\\ z=1+3t$ 的距离与垂足坐标。","record_version_sha256":"43613eb7e94996b67eb0f5ef6a966f2b58ee125effcbe8257ab7c20a0c7f4de9","solution":"直线上取点 $P_0(1,1,1)$、方向 $\\vec s=(1,2,3)$。$\\overrightarrow{P_0P}=(0,1,2)$。叉积 $\\overrightarrow{P_0P}\\times\\vec s=(1\\cdot 3-2\\cdot 2,\\ 2\\cdot 1-0\\cdot 3,\\ 0\\cdot 2-1\\cdot 1)=(-1,2,-1)$，模 $\\sqrt{6}$；$|\\vec s|=\\sqrt{14}$。距离 $d=\\dfrac{\\sqrt6}{\\sqrt{14}}=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3}{7}}$。垂足参数 $t^*=\\dfrac{\\overrightarrow{P_0P}\\cdot\\vec s}{|\\vec s|^2}=\\dfrac{0+2+6}{14}=\\dfrac{4}{7}$，垂足 $Q=\\left(1+\\dfrac{4}{7},1+\\dfrac{8}{7},1+\\dfrac{12}{7}\\right)=\\left(\\dfrac{11}{7},\\dfrac{15}{7},\\dfrac{19}{7}\\right)$。","source_line":47,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"点到直线×投影","task_sha256":"1e5c030427c3f378e816ddd491c6b1a0684bca1d20c480142ab305a67c8fc447"}
{"answer":"$\\sqrt2$","category":"解析几何","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-geom-003","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":395,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"bc6f880bb6c506071fea9837e9ef56d149b2631e021c509a2c832aeac54b1dd4","problem":"求异面直线 $l_1:\\begin{cases}x=1+t\\\\y=2t\\\\z=3+t\\end{cases}$ 与 $l_2:\\begin{cases}x=2s\\\\y=1-s\\\\z=2s\\end{cases}$ 之间的距离。","record_version_sha256":"61c65b4bf9ab263b29378a2ce542e1364a235a208d4720d38e12283ccc19f37e","solution":"$\\vec{s_1}=(1,2,1)$，$\\vec{s_2}=(2,-1,2)$，取点 $P_1=(1,0,3)\\in l_1$、$P_2=(0,1,0)\\in l_2$。公垂线方向 $\\vec n=\\vec{s_1}\\times\\vec{s_2}=(2\\cdot 2-1\\cdot(-1),\\ 1\\cdot 2-1\\cdot 2,\\ 1\\cdot(-1)-2\\cdot 2)=(5,0,-5)$，取 $(1,0,-1)$。$\\overrightarrow{P_1P_2}=(-1,1,-3)$。距离 $d=\\dfrac{|\\overrightarrow{P_1P_2}\\cdot\\vec n|}{|\\vec n|}=\\dfrac{|-1-0+3|}{\\sqrt2}=\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt2}=\\sqrt2$。","source_line":48,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"异面直线×公垂线","task_sha256":"62926f95e7c386d17a36cbf31a08dda3cb5d279117bf4c3f77fea4f4a71418fe"}
{"answer":"相切，切点 $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)$","category":"解析几何","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-geom-004","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":396,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"6ce4e44a0b7a0e8da372b1f264e141d53fdeebfa298c6dfed5852f5f25f49e27","problem":"判断平面 $x+2y+2z=3$ 与球面 $x^2+y^2+z^2=1$ 的位置关系，若相切求切点。","record_version_sha256":"26ecb025782bd9ee91ecab91e9d6cfb6150c979bb0f6502961384bb8b716d61a","solution":"球心 $O(0,0,0)$ 到平面的距离 $d=\\dfrac{|0+0+0-3|}{\\sqrt{1+4+4}}=\\dfrac{3}{3}=1$，等于球半径 $1$，故平面与球面相切。切点在球心到平面的垂线上：$\\overrightarrow{OQ}$ 沿法向量 $(1,2,2)$，且 $|OQ|=1$，$Q=\\dfrac{1}{3}(1,2,2)=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)$。验证在平面上：$\\dfrac{1}{3}+\\dfrac{4}{3}+\\dfrac{4}{3}=\\dfrac{9}{3}=3$。","source_line":49,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"平面×球面","task_sha256":"b9a3fff6e6c1594c57aad49618210127a1613669cb75f5d9dc21ca063d94d588"}
{"answer":"$\\dfrac{1}{2}$","category":"概率论","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-prob-001","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":418,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"f4252bb475ba10b8908959f1040abbf5fddf2cd3c07667ef03929b0a58457329","problem":"两车间各承担总产量的 $60\\%$ 与 $40\\%$，次品率分别为 $2\\%$ 与 $3\\%$。随机抽取一件产品发现是次品，求它来自第一车间的概率。","record_version_sha256":"b71644bf95ccd80a1401a084ac1c5045af303224a899bd470569cee7cf6302b9","solution":"记 $A_1$=来自第一车间，$A_2$=来自第二车间，$B$=次品。$P(A_1)=0.6$，$P(A_2)=0.4$，$P(B|A_1)=0.02$，$P(B|A_2)=0.03$。由全概率公式 $P(B)=0.6\\times 0.02+0.4\\times 0.03=0.012+0.012=0.024$。由贝叶斯公式 $P(A_1|B)=\\dfrac{P(B|A_1)P(A_1)}{P(B)}=\\dfrac{0.012}{0.024}=\\dfrac{1}{2}$。","source_line":71,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"全概率公式×贝叶斯公式","task_sha256":"587caaa6a4d3dbc856c3c7590c284742a8fb912589708a2552f1dd1238970ded"}
{"answer":"$P(X=3)=0.266827932$；$P(X\\le 1)=0.1493083459$","category":"概率论","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-prob-002","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":419,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"6b8c9f2fd893c23f417a96738ee3c316cd7b3d5e8c5c67d04f2f8b8e0daacc40","problem":"设 $X\\sim B\\!\\left(10,\\dfrac{3}{10}\\right)$。求 $P(X=3)$ 与 $P(X\\le 1)$ 的精确值。","record_version_sha256":"cc5d397098b4722681b09ff983220e0b87ee58db3fbe548e23be34930f1bfcfa","solution":"$P(X=k)=\\binom{10}{k}\\left(\\dfrac{3}{10}\\right)^k\\left(\\dfrac{7}{10}\\right)^{10-k}$。$P(X=3)=\\binom{10}{3}\\cdot 0.3^3\\cdot 0.7^7=120\\times 0.027\\times 0.0823543=0.266827932$。$P(X\\le 1)=P(X=0)+P(X=1)=0.7^{10}+10\\times 0.3\\times 0.7^9=0.0282475249+3\\times 0.040353607=0.0282475249+0.121060821=0.1493083459=\\dfrac{1493083459}{10^{10}}$。","source_line":72,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"二项分布×组合计数","task_sha256":"e265b3be116b1db390896cac585765e265c2704d03840545f2de85d1ddc162ea"}
{"answer":"$E[X]=np$；$\\operatorname{Var}(X)=np(1-p)$","category":"概率论","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-prob-003","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":420,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"4cdfd490cd5498b92fd1ae934b7c72c647e936ce5825399cd33e74d106ac6420","problem":"用指示变量法推导 $X\\sim B(n,p)$ 的期望与方差。","record_version_sha256":"e2e367bde625732ee7e25b98f1024b33802e65c10a82a0fe4d2a05beef441f41","solution":"设 $X=\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=1}^{n}X_i$，其中 $X_i$ 为第 $i$ 次试验成功的指示变量（独立，$P(X_i=1)=p$）。$E[X_i]=p$，由期望线性性 $E[X]=np$。$\\operatorname{Var}(X_i)=E[X_i^2]-p^2=p-p^2=p(1-p)$。由独立性 $\\operatorname{Var}(X)=\\displaystyle\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\operatorname{Var}(X_i)=np(1-p)$（独立变量的方差可加）。","source_line":73,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"期望×方差×指示变量","task_sha256":"2c18f9314c94afea6d418d15cbcb84de7b5fff35ea8fb4a4fc3e2e4dc7552451"}
{"answer":"$F(x)=\\begin{cases}0,&x\\le 0\\\\x^3,&0<x<1\\\\1,&x\\ge 1\\end{cases}$；$P\\!\\left(X>\\dfrac12\\right)=\\dfrac{7}{8}$；$E[X]=\\dfrac{3}{4}$","category":"概率论","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-prob-004","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":421,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"f0904d763444a0fe6ee487a6d7f2486316cc4e355f9a74f1e952888d51c86a8f","problem":"设 $X$ 的密度为 $f(x)=3x^2$（$0<x<1$）。求 $X$ 的分布函数、$P\\!\\left(X>\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$ 与 $E[X]$。","record_version_sha256":"2b467a80db8b2793f38a57c8aeb27a083f316dd66c9b54033454542d52a80f13","solution":"分布函数 $F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^x3t^2dt=x^3$（$0<x<1$；$x\\le 0$ 时为 0，$x\\ge 1$ 时为 1）。$P\\!\\left(X>\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)=1-F\\!\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)=1-\\dfrac{1}{8}=\\dfrac{7}{8}$。$E[X]=\\displaystyle\\int_0^1x\\cdot 3x^2dx=3\\int_0^1x^3dx=\\dfrac{3}{4}$。","source_line":74,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"连续分布×分布函数","task_sha256":"90c72c80f43f2ab26a2249c988d3adc960e629f755f2f6ada7389ed5c9716a10"}
{"answer":"$(x,y,z)=\\left(1,\\dfrac{2}{3},\\dfrac{5}{3}\\right)$","category":"高等代数","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-linalg-001","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":443,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"c52ca67ff09e2a893ae4d77f619f37cd1b515d4c011adaefa732878a14f86e37","problem":"用 Cramer 法则解方程组 $\\begin{cases}2x+y-z=1\\\\x-y+z=2\\\\x+2y+z=4\\end{cases}$。","record_version_sha256":"cb6588edbc010da5365843061352622f26530422e628c736b658e0297da79476","solution":"系数行列式 $D=\\begin{vmatrix}2&1&-1\\\\1&-1&1\\\\1&2&1\\end{vmatrix}=2\\cdot(-1-2)-1\\cdot(1-1)+(-1)\\cdot(2+1)=-6-0-3=-9$。$D_x=\\begin{vmatrix}1&1&-1\\\\2&-1&1\\\\4&2&1\\end{vmatrix}=1\\cdot(-1-2)-1\\cdot(2-4)+(-1)\\cdot(4+4)=-3+2-8=-9$，$x=\\dfrac{D_x}{D}=\\dfrac{-9}{-9}=1$。$D_y=\\begin{vmatrix}2&1&-1\\\\1&2&1\\\\1&4&1\\end{vmatrix}=2\\cdot(2-4)-1\\cdot(1-1)+(-1)\\cdot(4-2)=-4-0-2=-6$，$y=\\dfrac{-6}{-9}=\\dfrac{2}{3}$。$D_z=\\begin{vmatrix}2&1&1\\\\1&-1&2\\\\1&2&4\\end{vmatrix}=2\\cdot(-4-4)-1\\cdot(4-2)+1\\cdot(2+1)=-16-2+3=-15$，$z=\\dfrac{-15}{-9}=\\dfrac{5}{3}$。验证：$2\\cdot 1+\\dfrac{2}{3}-\\dfrac{5}{3}=1$；$1-\\dfrac{2}{3}+\\dfrac{5}{3}=2$；$1+\\dfrac{4}{3}+\\dfrac{5}{3}=4$。","source_line":96,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"行列式×线性方程组","task_sha256":"c31486c40800085dcb48dadd5834da2e197d64462177128292e6e14b46d3dd3c"}
{"answer":"$X=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$","category":"高等代数","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-linalg-002","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":444,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"0d2c980627d39455feb25eb4c15a05a9efe0ee32f4b40f29a833f24a32e22463","problem":"解矩阵方程 $AX=B$，其中 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\\\1&2\\end{pmatrix}$，$B=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}$。","record_version_sha256":"88e39808b9d2ba7f47b3a6a654b08969b15495d7c49c7f308d5bc4a03299879c","solution":"$\\det A=4-1=3$，$A^{-1}=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\begin{pmatrix}2&-1\\\\-1&2\\end{pmatrix}$。$X=A^{-1}B=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\begin{pmatrix}2&-1\\\\-1&2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\begin{pmatrix}6-3\\\\-3+6\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$。验证：$AX=\\begin{pmatrix}2&1\\\\1&2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}=B$。","source_line":97,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"矩阵方程×逆矩阵","task_sha256":"48a592731a7ca36426b894d22b37432fa8607ac23de026fbf36057fbd84e539d"}
{"answer":"$B=\\pm\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}$","category":"高等代数","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-linalg-003","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":445,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"387c878b5f9aa797eece87fa8eb5423bef5428afa6e6b597d534d151e05222e7","problem":"求所有满足 $B^2=A$ 的二阶实矩阵 $B$，其中 $A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}$。","record_version_sha256":"bfaa01e8438f4b5e696b3abfb125ca9284cc163059e1acab6b777aa5c4ef3790","solution":"设 $B=\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}$。由 $B^2=A$ 得 $B$ 与 $A$ 可交换（$BA=B^3=AB$）。与 $A=I+2N$（$N=\\begin{pmatrix}0&1\\\\0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，$N^2=0$）可交换的矩阵族为 $\\{aI+bN\\}$（解 $XA=AX$：$\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}a&2a+b\\\\c&2c+d\\end{pmatrix}$，$\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}a&b\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}a+2c&b+2d\\\\c&d\\end{pmatrix}$，逐项相等得 $c=0$、$a=d$，即 test-linalg-019 的结论）。故 $B=aI+bN$。代入 $B^2=(aI+bN)^2=a^2I+2abN$（$N^2=0$ 且 $IN=NI$），要求 $a^2I+2abN=I+2N$。比较系数：$a^2=1$、$2ab=2$。由 $a^2=1$ 得 $a=\\pm 1$；代入 $2ab=2$ 得 $b=a$，故 $(a,b)=(1,1)$ 或 $(-1,-1)$。于是 $B=\\pm(I+N)=\\pm\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}$。验证：$\\begin{pmatrix}1&1\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}^2=\\begin{pmatrix}1&2\\\\0&1\\end{pmatrix}=A$；$(-B)^2=A$ 同理。","source_line":98,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"矩阵方程×幂零分解","task_sha256":"cb256a9793933022f8a52bda4870798e6ceb70fe3a7d99f8176d5a032fe65360"}
{"answer":"$\\operatorname{rank}T=2$；$\\dim\\ker T=2$","category":"高等代数","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-linalg-004","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":446,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"1989784586ecdc03951fb9f5e1a96ccafa2c297cf7ad086b2069eb374626e35a","problem":"设线性变换 $T:\\mathbb R^4\\to\\mathbb R^3$ 的矩阵为 $\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&1&0\\\\0&1&1&0\\\\1&1&2&0\\end{pmatrix}$。求 $\\operatorname{rank}T$ 与 $\\dim\\ker T$。","record_version_sha256":"a145ad9a746115febc1ab512bf99b67232facf328e9a1b38b81230a874e53b9d","solution":"第三行 $=$ 第一行 $+$ 第二行，且第一、二行线性无关，故 $\\operatorname{rank}T=2$。由秩-零化度定理 $\\dim\\ker T=4-2=2$。核方程：$x_1+x_3=0$、$x_2+x_3=0$，即 $x_3$ 与 $x_4$ 自由，$\\ker T=\\operatorname{span}\\{(-1,-1,1,0)^T,(0,0,0,1)^T\\}$，维数 2。","source_line":99,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"秩×零度","task_sha256":"76b36ce01a8d63ef8addbceaa313981441ba6b250e42e5cc95bb860c7ba489a7"}
{"answer":"$\\dfrac{1}{3}$","category":"跨学科","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-x-001","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":483,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"d372588f5d8b0bd5989888840ed9171a77905c175544d7c045ed4909d673bd45","problem":"设 $X$ 服从参数 $p=\\dfrac{1}{2}$ 的几何分布（抛硬币直到正面）。求 $P(X$ 为偶数$)$ 的精确值。","record_version_sha256":"72d3f46a9733a7d177d7345e7d13395a4f441531831622c978a7ce0495f832e1","solution":"$P(X=k)=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^k$。$P(X$ 为偶数$)=\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}P(X=2k)=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^{2k}=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4}\\right)^k=\\dfrac{1/4}{1-1/4}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$。","source_line":136,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"概率论×级数","task_sha256":"54f5db7a7fefbaf436d973bde21afb3ee5e4004f6de350fdbf25b89bbb79621d"}
{"answer":"$f_Y(y)=2y$（$0<y<1$）；$E[Y]=\\dfrac{2}{3}$","category":"跨学科","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-x-002","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":484,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"275580d2e7712a5c13566241b3cb97da2251f47bd9c3af545b896e9b7af8b576","problem":"设 $X\\sim U(0,1)$，求 $Y=\\sqrt{X}$ 的密度与 $E[Y]$。","record_version_sha256":"e177fab0e816135e2f69660ba001bffa75a8574e3be44f4d72ea44555f122f90","solution":"$y=\\sqrt{x}$ 严格递增，反函数 $x=y^2$（$0<y<1$），$\\left|\\dfrac{dx}{dy}\\right|=2y$。$f_Y(y)=f_X(y^2)\\cdot 2y=2y$（$0<y<1$）。$E[Y]=\\displaystyle\\int_0^1y\\cdot 2y\\,dy=\\dfrac{2}{3}$。验证：$E[\\sqrt{X}]=\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\sqrt{x}\\,dx=\\left[\\dfrac{2}{3}x^{3/2}\\right]_0^1=\\dfrac{2}{3}$，一致。","source_line":137,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"概率论×微积分","task_sha256":"3db4f4d2274a59865742db08c8d84c528c7935571e7700cbd3753eebfde19967"}
{"answer":"证毕","category":"跨学科","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-x-003","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":485,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"a555ec7374c42d4547f8908eb9b104d9b91aafe0453898dde5667c2d63ede2fe","problem":"设 $A$ 为常矩阵。证明 $\\dfrac{d}{dt}e^{tA}=Ae^{tA}$。","record_version_sha256":"b93d10527a1e78e530bc260c21496b7ceb791f45d317599766527a93857e6307","solution":"$e^{tA}=\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{t^kA^k}{k!}$（对任意 $t$ 收敛）。逐项求导：$\\dfrac{d}{dt}e^{tA}=\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{kt^{k-1}A^k}{k!}=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{t^{k-1}A^k}{(k-1)!}=A\\sum_{m=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{t^mA^m}{m!}=Ae^{tA}$（$A$ 为常数矩阵，可提出求和号外）。故 $\\dfrac{d}{dt}e^{tA}=Ae^{tA}$，即矩阵指数是矩阵微分方程 $X'=AX$、$X(0)=I$ 的解。","source_line":138,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"线性代数×微积分","task_sha256":"a097afdb57dcc51b13777605a27dce517e3a99ab30b0b874f10f2e247baa5ed6"}
{"answer":"稳态分布 $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)$；$\\pi^T$ 是 $P^T$ 特征值 $1$ 的特征向量","category":"跨学科","does_not_bind_deleted_10_03_run":true,"group":"test","id":"test-x-004","identity_verified":true,"input_binding":"active-497-row-bindings.jsonl","input_binding_line":486,"input_hash_omits_answer":true,"input_sha256":"27a3f9f15a3e6ff022d9ef2c5fe560ee7c2ba47276847c7bcbe8ff6a5c946483","problem":"转移矩阵为 $P$ 的马尔可夫链，稳态分布 $\\pi$ 满足 $\\pi=\\pi P$。说明稳态分布是 $P^T$ 的特征值 $1$ 对应的特征向量，并求 $P=\\begin{pmatrix}0.5&0.5\\\\0.25&0.75\\end{pmatrix}$ 的稳态分布。","record_version_sha256":"dbbc5a1ab890002c66d05a135a1b3a213303ec876d8eccb56fabe5114b438502","solution":"$\\pi=\\pi P$ 转置得 $P^T\\pi^T=\\pi^T$，即稳态分布（转置后）是 $P^T$ 的特征值 $1$ 的特征向量（随机矩阵行和为 1，恒有特征值 1）。对给定 $P$：解 $\\pi_1=0.5\\pi_1+0.25\\pi_2$（即 $0.5\\pi_1=0.25\\pi_2$，$\\pi_1=\\dfrac{\\pi_2}{2}$）与 $\\pi_1+\\pi_2=1$，得 $\\pi=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)$。验证：$\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)P=\\left(\\dfrac{1}{3},\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)$。","source_line":139,"source_path":"data/v2/test/dataset_test.jsonl","source_raw_sha256":"d4de0bb6a86ff0aeeb23cfab79a013236cce742f020d980c4db31df76c94fd2a","sub_category":"概率论×线性代数","task_sha256":"5453e577b5a619b8d35a5d3a789cd463f27ddce1cc0d1ee2f1e84358a0b42dd9"}
